<title>GERMANY: H.I.S. share offer priced at 39 marks.</title>
<headline>H.I.S. share offer priced at 39 marks.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German fashion group H.I.S. AG will be priced at 39 marks after a bookbuilding period in which they were offered at 33 to 40 marks, the lead bank, Commerzbank AG, said on Monday.</p>
<p>H.I.S., based in Munich, had offered 1.92 million shares.</p>
<p>The shares will begin trading on the Frankfurt and Munich bourses on Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
